   "install": {
    "title": "Setup",
    "html": "<pre><code class=\"language-sh\"># yarn should be installed first\n\ngit clone https://github.com/GoogleChrome/lighthouse\n\ncd lighthouse\nyarn\nyarn build-all\n</code></pre>",
    "truncated": false,
    "chars": 135
   },
   "usage": {
    "title": "Using Lighthouse in Chrome DevTools",
    "html": "<p>Lighthouse is integrated directly into the Chrome DevTools, under the \"Lighthouse\" panel.</p>\n<p><strong>Installation</strong>: install <a href=\"https://www.google.com/chrome/browser\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Chrome</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>Run it</strong>: open Chrome DevTools, select the Lighthouse panel, and hit \"Generate report\".</p>\n<img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/2766281/204185043-9c49abe5-baee-4b26-b5ce-ece410661213.png\" alt=\"Lighthouse integration in Chrome DevTools.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"550\" />",
    "truncated": false,
